he TV show, or the other TV show?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have only seen the recent TV show so that one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23758-hoist","name":"Hoist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23758_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-18T15:21:51-08:00","id":1187360,"title":"","content":"The Doctor from Doctor Who makes an interesting Marauder from a certain slant. <br /> <br /> If you know LeFanu's Uncle Silas both Silas and the Governess would make interesting Nephandi.<br /> <br /> Most of Batman's rogues gallery are either Marauder or Nephandi models.<br /> <br /> The story &quot;Casting of the Runes&quot; has a Nephandus in it. Watch &quot;Night of the Demon&quot; to see the film version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 02-18-2018, 06:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-27T12:49:13-08:00","id":1189981,"title":"","content":"My best Marauder inspiration is from an Anime named Suzumiya haruhi no yuuutsu. Suzumiya is the marauder.What strikes me in the anime is the subtle touch of Mage all through it. Quiet, paradox, there is good representation of them in this anime. A quote to keep in mind, &quot;Since there is no defined consequences of paradox, you cannot prove that right now, we are not suffering from paradox&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> 